    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d678">

                <pb facs="0824" n="750" xml:id="pg750"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 763.72119/708</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The British Embassy to the
                            Department of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <p rendition="#center">
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Memorandum</hi>
                </p>
                <p>His Majesty’s Government [<hi rendition="#italic">sic</hi>] has received
                    instructions to inform the United States Government with a view to avoiding
                    possible misconception that the fact that Mr. Henderson is accompanying the Russian and English Socialist
                    delegates to Rome and Paris does not in any way commit His Majesty’s Government
                    to any decisions that may be arrived at by the Socialist conferences in those
                    Capitals nor to the general policy which was proposed at the Socialist
                    conference at Stockholm.</p>
                <closer>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-left">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi>
                        </placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1917-08-01"><hi
                                rendition="#italic">August 1, 1917</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
